  "properties": {
    "title": "pgRouting feature frenzy",
    "description": "Feature frenzy of 10 years of pgRouting evolution: On 2013 with the new version 2.0 there were only 11 graph functions, now after 12 years we have 89 functions and a grand total of  222 different signatures, when variations or overloads of the functions are considered.\n\nWe will cover:\r\n- What is pgRouting?\r\n- Where can pgRouting be used?\r\n- pgRouting function classification.\r\n- Frenzy of pgRouting features from A to Z",
